keywords:
  - FBSDE
  - BSDE
  - deep-learning
  - PDE
  - quantitative-finance
  - pytorch
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch library for solving high-dimensional partial differential
  equations and forward-backward stochastic differential equations with the
  Deep BSDE method, featuring a conditioned NAIS-Net architecture,
  Multi-Level Monte Carlo time-stepping, and validation against exact
  solutions.
